Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.60,0:00:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}As a child, washing my father's\Nfeet,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.12,0:00:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}my heart would fill with so many\Nblessings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.60,0:00:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}'May God bless you, may He go\Nbefore you on your path,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.96,0:00:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}may He raise you in wisdom and\Nunderstanding,' he would say.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.10,0:00:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Words from a pure heart were sown\Nin me like a seed, and they grew.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.10,0:00:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Many years passed. My father went\Nhome to his Creator,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.86,0:00:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}but his blessing stayed with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.60,0:00:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Today I am a software engineer.\NThe peace,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.32,0:00:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}wisdom and honour he wished for me\Ncame true in my life, one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.64,0:00:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}In every success of mine, I\Nremember my father's pure heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.64,0:01:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}And when my father looks on my\Nlife from heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.53,0:01:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}his heart fills with joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.64,0:01:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Seeing his daughter live by his\Nblessing, he rejoices.
